{%- comment -%}
  Benefits — per gem
{%- endcomment -%}
  {%- case gem_handle -%}
    {%- when 'emerald' -%}
      <div class="gem-tab gem-tab--emerald">
        <h2>Benefits</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Mental Clarity —</strong> Brings structure to thought without strain. Emerald does not sharpen the mind through intensity; it removes internal noise, allowing focus and coherence to emerge more naturally.</li>
          <li><strong>Communication & Expression —</strong> Supports clearer articulation, calmer speech, and more measured self-expression. Particularly useful for those whose success depends on how well they explain, negotiate, teach, write, or advise.</li>
          <li><strong>Learning & Memory —</strong> Strengthens comprehension, retention, and the ability to absorb knowledge over time. A valuable support during study phases, exams, training periods, or intellectually demanding work.</li>
          <li><strong>Calm Thinking —</strong> Helps settle restless, overactive, or scattered mental states. When Mercury is imbalanced, the mind can move too quickly to be useful; Emerald restores rhythm and composure.</li>
          <li><strong>Judgment & Discernment —</strong> Encourages balanced, reasoned decision-making over reactive thinking. It supports choices that feel considered rather than rushed — especially in business, strategy, and communication-heavy roles.</li>
          <li><strong>Confidence Without Aggression —</strong> Builds intellectual confidence in a quiet way. Not louder speech, but more certain speech. Not faster decisions, but cleaner ones.</li>
          <li><strong>Mercury Alignment —</strong> When Budh needs strengthening or steadying, Emerald helps bring its qualities into better balance: intelligence, adaptability, memory, logic, and refined communication.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
