        <h2>Benefits of Tourmaline</h2>
        <p>Tourmaline works gently, adapting to the wearer rather than imposing a fixed direction. Its influence is cumulative and quietly felt — less a shift than a settling.</p>
        <p>Emotional Balance — Steadies moods and supports the emotional regulation that sensitivity and overstimulation can undermine</p>
