        <h2>Benefits of Star Sapphire</h2>
        <p>Star Sapphire channels Saturn’s steady, structural energy.</p>
        <p>Alignment & Direction — Encourages clarity in uncertain situations</p>
        <p>Stability & Grounding — Supports emotional and mental steadiness</p>
        <p>Mental Stillness — Reduces restlessness and scattered thinking</p>
