        <p>Calm Strength — Builds resilience without force</p>
        <p>Quality — What to Look For</p>
        <p>In Star Sapphire, the quality of the star matters more than colour or size.</p>
        <p>Choose stones with:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>Sharp, well-defined six-rayed star</li>
        <li>Centre-aligned star across the dome</li>
        <li>Smooth movement under light</li>
        <li>Strong contrast between star and body colour</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Avoid:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>Blurry or broken stars</li>
        <li>Stars visible only under strong spotlight</li>
        <li>Off-centre or uneven rays</li>
        <li>Painted or artificial star effects</li>
        <li>Opaque stones sold only for “visible star”</li>
        </ul>
        <p>A visible star is not enough — its clarity and movement define quality.</p>
      </div>
